        {
          "type": "starrailexpress:role_render",
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "parameters": {
            "label": "ponder.starrailexpress.label.vision",
            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "You can see every security camera and monitor console on the map from the start of the round (highlighted in cyan).",
                "zh_cn": "你可以透视到所有监控摄像头的位置(任务点透视)。",
                "zh_tw": "你可以透視到所有監控攝像頭的位置(任務點透視)。"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "[Infrared Scanner] Costs 150 coins. The feed gains night vision, and only while you are actually watching this camera's feed does the infrared light illuminate the watched cone: players inside it who are not hidden get highlighted, so you can pin them down through the lens. The cone follows wherever you aim the camera; leave the feed or switch cameras and this camera's infrared goes dark immediately. Cooldown 90s.",
                "zh_cn": "【红外线扫描仪】按技能键花费 150 金币为视野 15 格锥形范围内的摄像头安装。该摄像头画面自带夜视效果；当你正在观看这台摄像头的监控画面时，会使监控范围内的所有玩家发光，此范围会跟随你的镜头移动。冷却 90 秒。",
                "zh_tw": "【紅外線掃描器】按技能鍵花費 150 金幣為視野 15 格錐形範圍內的攝像頭安裝。該攝像頭畫面自帶夜視效果；當你正在觀看這臺攝像頭的監控畫面時，會使監控範圍內的所有玩家發光，此範圍會跟隨你的鏡頭移動。冷卻 90 秒。"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
